msgid "# Step-5-Preview"
msgstr "# Step-5-Preview"

msgid "## 1 Introduction {: #1-introduction }"
msgstr "## 1 简介 {: #1-introduction }"

msgid ""
"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
"use in the production environment."
msgstr ""
"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 和 Decode 的基本流程，不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**客户侧生产环境推荐使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM Ascend。**"

msgid ""
"**Step-5-Preview** is a next-generation flagship Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model\n"
"developed by StepFun. It has **600B** total parameters with **27B** active per\n"
"token, supports a **1M-token** context window and vision input, and is validated\n"
"only on **950DT products** (96GB × 8 per node). Other Ascend hardware, such as\n"
"the A3 series, is not supported for `Step-5-Preview`."
msgstr ""
"**Step-5-Preview** 是 StepFun 开发的下一代旗舰级混合专家（MoE）模型，总参数量为 **600B**，每个 token 激活"
" **27B**，支持 **1M token** 上下文窗口和视觉输入，且仅在 **Ascend 950DT系列产品**（每节点 96GB × "
"8）上完成验证。其他昇腾硬件（如 A3 系列）不支持 `Step-5-Preview`。"

msgid ""
"This document shows the main verification steps of the model, including\n"
"supported features, prerequisites, installation, online service deployment,\n"
"functional verification, accuracy and performance evaluation, performance\n"
"tuning, and FAQs."
msgstr "本文档介绍该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、前提条件、安装、在线服务部署、功能验证、精度与性能评估、性能调优以及常见问题。"

msgid "This guide covers two deployment scenarios on 950DT products:"
msgstr "本指南涵盖 Ascend 950DT系列产品上的两种部署场景："

msgid ""
"- **Multi-node co-located deployment**: two nodes, with Prefill and Decode\n"
"  running in one DP group, targeting the full 1M-token context.\n"
"- **Prefill-Decode (PD) separation deployment**: six nodes (2 Prefill + 4\n"
"  Decode), with an optional KV cache pool for prefix reuse."
msgstr ""
"- **多节点混布部署**：两个节点，Prefill 与 Decode 运行在同一个 DP 组中，面向完整的 1M token 上下文。\n"
"- **Prefill-Decode（PD）分离部署**：六个节点（2 个 Prefill + 4 个 Decode），可选配 KV cache 池用于前缀复用。"

msgid "Step-5-Preview is supported in **vLLM Ascend v0.34.0rc1 and later**."
msgstr "**vLLM Ascend v0.34.0rc1 及更高版本**支持 Step-5-Preview。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features {: #2-supported-features }"
msgstr "## 2 支持的特性 {: #2-supported-features }"

msgid ""
"Together, the deployment examples in this document exercise tensor parallelism\n"
"(TP), pipeline parallelism (PP), expert parallelism (EP), data parallelism (DP),\n"
"native Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) speculative decoding with three tokens, decode graph capture,\n"
"shared-expert data parallelism, shared-expert overlap, and FlashComm1. Each\n"
"topology in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) enables the subset listed\n"
"there: Prefill uses TP with PP, Decode uses TP with DP, and only the Decode role\n"
"captures the decode graph. The PD examples additionally enable Prefill-Decode\n"
"disaggregation, and the pool example in\n"
"[Section 5.3](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-pool) adds the KV cache pool."
msgstr ""
"本文档中的部署示例综合运用了张量并行（TP）、流水线并行（PP）、专家并行（EP）、数据并行（DP）、原生多 Token 预测（MTP）投机解码（3 个"
" token）、Decode 图捕获、共享专家数据并行、共享专家 overlap 以及 FlashComm1。[第 5 节](#5-online-"
"service-deployment)中的每种拓扑仅启用其中列出的子集：Prefill 使用 TP 与 PP，Decode 使用 TP 与 DP，且只有"
" Decode 角色进行 Decode 图捕获。PD 示例还额外启用了 Prefill-Decode 分离，而[第 5.3 节](#53-pd-"
"separation-with-kv-cache-pool)中的 KV cache 池示例则增加了 KV cache 池。"

msgid ""
"Only the features enabled by the commands in this document are covered.\n"
"    Other features, such as LoRA, are not validated for `Step-5-Preview`."
msgstr ""
"本文仅覆盖文档中命令所启用的特性。\n"
"    其他特性（如 LoRA）未针对 `Step-5-Preview` 进行验证。"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites {: #3-prerequisites }"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件 {: #3-prerequisites }"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weight {: #31-model-weight }"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重 {: #31-model-weight }"

msgid ""
"Download the checkpoint from ModelScope for the hardware listed below. Only the\n"
"Ascend-adapted W8A8-MXFP8 checkpoint is used in this guide; the official weights\n"
"on Hugging Face use a different quantization format and are not\n"
"interchangeable. The deployment commands use the checkpoint directory as a local\n"
"mount path, not as a download source."
msgstr ""
"请针对下方列出的硬件从 ModelScope 下载 checkpoint。本指南仅使用昇腾适配的 W8A8-MXFP8 "
"checkpoint；Hugging Face 上的官方权重使用不同的量化格式，二者不可互换。部署命令中的 checkpoint "
"目录仅作为本地挂载路径，而非下载来源。"

msgid "| Checkpoint | Hardware | Deployment | Download | Notes |"
msgstr "| 权重文件 | 硬件 | 部署方式 | 下载 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `Step-5-Preview-w8a8-mxfp8` | 950DT products (96GB × 8 per node) | 2 nodes"
" for multi-node co-located deployment; 6 nodes for PD deployment; KV cache "
"pool optional | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Step-5-Preview-w8a8-mxfp8) | Ascend-adapted W8A8-MXFP8 weights; "
"required for all validated configurations. |"
msgstr ""
"| `Step-5-Preview-w8a8-mxfp8` | Ascend 950DT系列产品（每节点 96GB × 8） | 多节点混布部署需 2 "
"个节点；PD 部署需 6 个节点；KV cache 池可选 | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Step-5-Preview-w8a8-mxfp8) | 昇腾适配的 W8A8-MXFP8 权重；所有已验证配置均需使用。 |"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to download the weights to a shared directory across nodes,\n"
"such as `/root/.cache/`, so that every serving node loads the same path."
msgstr "建议将权重下载到各节点共享的目录中（例如 `/root/.cache/`），以便每个推理服务节点加载同一路径。"

msgid ""
"> **Path description**: Download the model weights to a directory of your choice and record it. Use the same directory on every node and ensure that the model path in the subsequent deployment commands matches this directory.\n"
">\n"
"### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication (Optional) {: #32-verify-multi-node-communication-optional }"
msgstr ""
"> **路径说明**：将模型权重下载到您选择的目录并记录该路径。请在每个节点上使用同一目录，并确保后续部署命令中的模型路径与该目录一致。\n"
">\n"
"### 3.2 验证多节点通信（可选） {: #32-verify-multi-node-communication-optional }"

msgid ""
"For multi-node deployment, verify the communication environment by following"
" [Verify Multi-node Communication "
"Environment](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-"
"interconnect)."
msgstr ""
"进行多节点部署时，请参照[验证多节点通信环境](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"multi-node-interconnect)验证通信环境。"

msgid "## 4 Installation {: #4-installation }"
msgstr "## 4 安装 {: #4-installation }"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation {: #41-docker-image-installation }"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装 {: #41-docker-image-installation }"

msgid "#### Download Docker Image {: #download-docker-image }"
msgstr "#### 下载 Docker 镜像 {: #download-docker-image }"

msgid "#### Create Docker Container {: #create-docker-container }"
msgstr "#### 创建 Docker 容器 {: #create-docker-container }"

msgid ""
"Inside the container, run `npu-smi info` and confirm that all eight NPUs are"
" visible. Run `vllm --version` to check the installed vLLM version."
msgstr ""
"在容器内执行 `npu-smi info`，确认八张 NPU 均可见。执行 `vllm --version` 查看已安装的 vLLM 版本。"

msgid ""
"The container runs without `--privileged`: Ascend Docker Runtime injects the"
" eight Davinci devices selected by `-e ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0-7`, so no "
"`--device` entry is needed for them. Add `--device` only if you start the "
"container without that runtime."
msgstr ""
"容器无需以 `--privileged` 运行：Ascend Docker Runtime 会注入由 `-e "
"ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0-7` 选定的八个 Davinci 设备，因此无需为它们添加 `--device` "
"配置项。只有在未使用该 runtime 启动容器时，才需要添加 `--device`。"

msgid ""
"The `-v` option maps directories. **You should map the weight directory into the container** so that the weights can be accessed inside the container. The local weight path is `/root/.cache`; modify it according to the actual situation.\n"
"The `docker run` command above opens an interactive container shell. Use that shell for the following steps. To open an additional shell, run this command from another terminal on the host:"
msgstr ""
"`-v` 选项用于映射目录。**您应将权重目录映射到容器中**，以便在容器内访问权重。本地权重路径为 `/root/.cache`，请根据实际情况修改。\n"
"上述 `docker run` 命令会打开一个交互式容器 shell。请使用该 shell 执行后续步骤。如需再打开一个 shell，请在宿主机的另一个终端中执行以下命令："

msgid ""
"Expected result: the container is listed with status `Up`. In the container "
"terminal, verify the installed package versions:"
msgstr "预期结果：容器出现在列表中且状态为 `Up`。在容器终端中，验证已安装的包版本："

msgid ""
"Expected result: the version information for both packages is displayed; "
"`vllm-ascend` is the preview build shipped in this image."
msgstr "预期结果：显示两个包的版本信息；`vllm-ascend` 为该镜像中自带的预览版本。"

msgid ""
"Use the same image and absolute checkpoint path on every participating node."
" Reserve enough host memory and shared memory for Engram CPU offload and "
"local DP sharing."
msgstr ""
"在所有参与节点上使用相同的镜像和绝对 checkpoint 路径。请预留足够的主机内存与共享内存，用于 Engram CPU offload 和本地 "
"DP 共享。"

msgid ""
"The KV cache pool in [Section 5.3](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-pool) "
"uses the MemCache backend over the `device_urma` transport on 950DT "
"products. That transport needs the `/dev/uburma` node inside the container; "
"check it with `ls /dev | grep uburma` after the container starts. The pool "
"reads its configuration files from `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`, which the "
"container mounts at the same path, so create that directory on every node "
"before starting Docker. Remove the mount if you do not use the KV cache "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"[第 5.3 节](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-pool)中的 KV cache 池在 950DT 产品上通过 "
"`device_urma` 传输使用 MemCache 后端。该传输方式需要容器内的 `/dev/uburma` 节点；容器启动后，可用 `ls "
"/dev | grep uburma` 检查该节点。KV cache 池从 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` "
"读取配置文件，容器会将此目录挂载到相同路径，因此在启动 Docker 之前，需要在每个节点上创建该目录。如果不使用 KV cache 池，请移除该挂载。"

msgid "### 4.2 Source Code Installation {: #42-source-code-installation }"
msgstr "### 4.2 源码安装 {: #42-source-code-installation }"

msgid ""
"To build from source, follow the [software environment installation "
"guide](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-software-"
"environment) and check out the `main` branch of vLLM Ascend. Use the "
"upstream vLLM commit recorded in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` at the "
"selected vLLM Ascend revision."
msgstr ""
"如需从源码构建，请遵循[软件环境安装指南](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"software-environment)，并检出 vLLM Ascend 的 `main` 分支。请使用所选 vLLM Ascend 版本中记录于 "
"`.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` 的上游 vLLM 提交。"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment {: #5-online-service-deployment }"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署 {: #5-online-service-deployment }"

msgid ""
"This chapter covers the two supported topologies: multi-node co-located\n"
"deployment and multi-node PD separation, the latter with an optional KV cache\n"
"pool. Set the model path as described in [Section 3.1](#31-model-weight), and\n"
"use the values of the selected role script. Hardware-specific and role-specific\n"
"values are not interchangeable between Prefill and Decode."
msgstr ""
"本章介绍两种受支持的拓扑：\n"
"多节点共置部署与多节点 PD 分离部署，后者可选配 KV cache 池。\n"
"按[第 3.1 节](#31-model-weight)所述设置模型路径，并使用所选角色脚本中的取值。\n"
"硬件相关与角色相关的取值在 Prefill 与 Decode 之间不可互换。"

msgid ""
"### 5.1 Multi-Node Co-located Deployment {: #51-multi-node-co-located-"
"deployment }"
msgstr "### 5.1 多节点共置部署 {: #51-multi-node-co-located-deployment }"

msgid ""
"The validated co-located deployment uses two 950DT product nodes with eight devices\n"
"per node. vLLM data parallelism spans the two nodes with two DP ranks per node,\n"
"and tensor parallelism uses four devices in each rank, so the resulting topology\n"
"is DP4/TP4/EP16. Prefill and Decode share the same engine and the same DP group,\n"
"and the combined context limit is 1048576 tokens."
msgstr ""
"经验证的共置部署使用两个 950DT 产品节点，每个节点八张设备卡。\n"
"vLLM 数据并行跨越这两个节点，每个节点两个 DP rank，\n"
"张量并行在每个 rank 内使用四张设备卡，因此最终拓扑\n"
"为 DP4/TP4/EP16。Prefill 与 Decode 共享同一个引擎和同一个 DP 组，\n"
"合并后的上下文上限为 1048576 个 token。"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"- Set `MODEL_PATH` to the container-visible checkpoint directory recorded in\n"
"  [Section 3.1](#31-model-weight).\n"
"- Set `NODE0_IP`, `NODE1_IP`, and `NIC_NAME` to each node's service IP and the\n"
"  local network interface. Set `HCCL_IF_IP` to the communication IP owned by\n"
"  that interface; use the same value as the service IP when the two are equal.\n"
"  `--host` always binds the service IP.\n"
"- Start Node 0 first, then start Node 1 as soon as possible. On Node 1,\n"
"  `NODE0_IP` must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
"- Node 1 joins the DP group as a headless worker with\n"
"  `--data-parallel-start-rank 2`. The group runs two local ranks per node, so\n"
"  rank `2` is the first global rank owned by the second node."
msgstr ""
"- 将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为\n"
"  [第 3.1 节](#31-model-weight)中记录的、容器内可见的权重目录。\n"
"- 将 `NODE0_IP`、`NODE1_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为各节点的服务 IP 和\n"
"  本地网络接口。将 `HCCL_IF_IP` 设置为该接口所拥有的通信 IP；\n"
"  当两者相同时，使用与服务 IP 相同的值。\n"
"  `--host` 始终绑定服务 IP。\n"
"- 先启动节点 0，然后尽快启动节点 1。在节点 1 上，\n"
"  `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"- 节点 1 以无头 worker 的身份、通过\n"
"  `--data-parallel-start-rank 2` 加入 DP 组。该组在每个节点上运行两个本地 rank，因此\n"
"  rank `2` 是第二个节点所拥有的第一个全局 rank。"

msgid "Run the following script on each node. Select the tab for the node:"
msgstr "在每个节点上运行以下脚本。请选择对应节点的标签页："

msgid "=== \"Node 0\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 0\""

msgid "=== \"Node 1\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 1\""

msgid "The following values differ between the master and the worker node:"
msgstr "以下取值在主节点与 worker 节点之间不同："

msgid "| Setting | Node 0 | Node 1 | Description |"
msgstr "| 配置项 | 节点 0 | 节点 1 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `LOCAL_IP` | Node 0 IP | Node 1 IP | Each node uses its own service IP. |"
msgstr "| `LOCAL_IP` | 节点 0 IP | 节点 1 IP | 每个节点使用自身的服务 IP。 |"

msgid ""
"| `NODE0_IP` | Not required | Node 0 IP | The worker uses this address to "
"join the DP group. |"
msgstr "| `NODE0_IP` | 不需要 | 节点 0 IP | worker 使用该地址加入 DP 组。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--headless` | Omitted | Enabled | The worker does not expose an API "
"endpoint. |"
msgstr "| `--headless` | 省略 | 启用 | worker 不对外暴露 API 端点。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-address` | `${NODE0_IP}` | `${NODE0_IP}` | Always "
"resolves to Node 0. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-address` | `${NODE0_IP}` | `${NODE0_IP}` | 始终解析为节点 0。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0` (default) | `2` | First global rank "
"owned by the node; every node needs a unique value. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0`（默认） | `2` | 该节点所拥有的第一个全局 "
"rank；每个节点都需要一个唯一值。 |"

msgid "Key multi-node co-located deployment parameters:"
msgstr "多节点共置部署的关键参数："

msgid "| Parameter | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 说明 |"

msgid "| `--tensor-parallel-size 4` | Uses four NPUs per DP rank. |"
msgstr "| `--tensor-parallel-size 4` | 每个 DP rank 使用四张 NPU。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-size 4` | Creates four global DP ranks across the two "
"nodes. |"
msgstr "| `--data-parallel-size 4` | 在两个节点上创建四个全局 DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-size-local 2` | Runs two DP ranks per node, so all eight "
"devices are in use with TP4. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-size-local 2` | 每个节点运行两个 DP rank，因此在 TP4 下全部八张设备卡都被使用。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` | Shards MoE experts across the DP and TP "
"domains, giving EP16. |"
msgstr "| `--enable-expert-parallel` | 在 DP 与 TP 域上分片 MoE 专家，从而得到 EP16。 |"

msgid "| `--max-model-len 1048576` | Combined input and output limit. |"
msgstr "| `--max-model-len 1048576` | 输入与输出的合计上限。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs 256`, `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` | Per-engine "
"scheduler limits. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-num-seqs 256`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` | 每个引擎的调度器限制。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--compilation-config` | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph replay for decode. |"
msgstr "| `--compilation-config` | 针对 decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图重放。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--additional-config` | Enables FlashComm1, shared-expert data "
"parallelism, and shared-expert overlap. |"
msgstr "| `--additional-config` | 启用 FlashComm1、共享专家数据并行与共享专家重叠。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--speculative-config` | Native MTP decoding with three speculative "
"tokens. |"
msgstr "| `--speculative-config` | 使用三个推测 token 的原生 MTP 解码。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, `--tool-call-parser step5` | Enables tool "
"calling and parses Step-5's native tool-call format into standard "
"`tool_calls`; without them `tools` requests are ignored. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-auto-tool-choice`、`--tool-call-parser step5` | 启用工具调用，并将 Step-5 "
"的原生工具调用格式解析为标准 `tool_calls`；若不设置这两项，`tools` 请求将被忽略。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--reasoning-parser step5` | Splits the output at Step-5's thinking "
"markers, returning the chain of thought in `reasoning_content` instead of "
"mixing it into `content`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--reasoning-parser step5` | 在 Step-5 的思考标记处切分输出，将思维链放在 "
"`reasoning_content` 中返回，而不是混入 `content`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1` | Replaces the default Hugging Face tokenizer "
"backend with the [fastokens](https://github.com/crusoecloud/fastokens) Rust "
"implementation, which is faster on long prompts. Install `fastokens` "
"(version 0.2.0 or later) in the same Python environment and check `python -c"
" \"import fastokens\"`; with the variable set and the package missing, the "
"engine stops at startup. Only the API server process on Node 0 builds a "
"tokenizer, so the variable has no effect on the headless worker. |"
msgstr ""
"| `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1` | 使用 "
"[fastokens](https://github.com/crusoecloud/fastokens) 的 Rust 实现替换默认的 Hugging"
" Face tokenizer 后端，该实现在长提示下速度更快。请在同一 Python 环境中安装 `fastokens`（0.2.0 "
"或更高版本）并执行 `python -c \"import fastokens\"` 进行检查；若设置了该变量但缺少该包，引擎会在启动时停止。只有节点 "
"0 上的 API server 进程会构建 tokenizer，因此该变量对无头 worker 没有影响。 |"

msgid ""
"Because the weights are large, the load time is related to the disk read "
"speed, and the first load usually takes about 10 minutes. After both nodes "
"have joined and node 0 reports `Application startup complete`, the service "
"is ready; see [Section 6](#6-functional-verification) for verification."
msgstr ""
"由于权重体积较大，加载时间与磁盘读取速度相关，首次加载通常需要约 10 分钟。两个节点都加入、且节点 0 输出 `Application startup"
" complete` 后，服务即就绪；验证方法见[第 6 节](#6-functional-verification)。"

msgid ""
"### 5.2 Multi-Node PD Separation Deployment (2P4D) {: #52-multi-node-pd-"
"separation-deployment-2p4d }"
msgstr ""
"### 5.2 多节点 PD 分离部署（2P4D） {: #52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment-2p4d }"

msgid ""
"The quantized model `Step-5-Preview-w8a8-mxfp8` is deployed on six 950DT\n"
"products (96GB × 8 per node). Prefill runs as one DP1/TP4/PP4 engine across P0–P1,\n"
"and Decode runs as one DP8/TP4 group across D0–D3 with two DP ranks per node.\n"
"Both roles enable expert parallelism, and a Proxy forwards client requests to\n"
"both roles."
msgstr ""
"量化模型 `Step-5-Preview-w8a8-mxfp8` 部署在六台 Ascend 950DT系列产品上\n"
"(每节点 96GB × 8)。Prefill 在 P0–P1 上以单个 DP1/TP4/PP4 引擎运行,\n"
"Decode 在 D0–D3 上以单个 DP8/TP4 组运行,每节点两个 DP rank。\n"
"两个角色都启用专家并行,并由 Proxy 将客户端请求转发给\n"
"两个角色。"

msgid ""
"The parallelism layout, `--max-model-len`, and the scheduler limits in this\n"
"section come from the validated Prefill and Decode scripts. Both roles use\n"
"`--max-model-len 1048576` and `--max-num-seqs 256`; Prefill uses\n"
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` and Decode uses `2048`."
msgstr ""
"本节中的并行布局、`--max-model-len` 以及调度器限制\n"
"均来自经过验证的 Prefill 和 Decode 脚本。两个角色都使用\n"
"`--max-model-len 1048576` 和 `--max-num-seqs 256`;Prefill 使用\n"
"`--max-num-batched-tokens 16384`,Decode 使用 `2048`。"

msgid ""
"- Set `MODEL_PATH` to the container-visible checkpoint directory recorded in\n"
"  [Section 3.1](#31-model-weight).\n"
"- Set the IP and NIC variables to each node's service IP, its communication IP,\n"
"  and the local interface that owns the communication IP.\n"
"- Start P0 before P1, and D0 before D1–D3. Every Prefill node uses the same\n"
"  master address and port; every Decode node uses the same DP address and DP RPC\n"
"  port.\n"
"- Only P0 and D0 expose the HTTP API. P1 and D1–D3 are headless workers, and\n"
"  every worker needs a unique node rank or DP start rank."
msgstr ""
"- 将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为 [3.1 节](#31-model-weight)中记录的容器内可见的 checkpoint 目录。\n"
"- 将 IP 和 NIC 变量设置为各节点的服务 IP、其通信 IP,\n"
"  以及持有该通信 IP 的本地网卡。\n"
"- 先启动 P0 再启动 P1,先启动 D0 再启动 D1–D3。每个 Prefill 节点使用相同的\n"
"  主地址和端口;每个 Decode 节点使用相同的 DP 地址和 DP RPC\n"
"  端口。\n"
"- 只有 P0 和 D0 对外暴露 HTTP API。P1 和 D1–D3 是无头 worker,\n"
"  每个 worker 都需要唯一的 node rank 或 DP start rank。"

msgid "| Role | Nodes | DP | TP | PP | EP | Context limit | HTTP API |"
msgstr "| 角色 | 节点 | DP | TP | PP | EP | 上下文长度限制 | HTTP API |"

msgid ""
"| MetaService | One node, co-located with P0 in the reference run ([Section "
"5.3](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-pool) only) | — | — | — | — | — | "
"`8000` (metrics) |"
msgstr ""
"| MetaService | 一个节点,在参考运行中与 P0 同机部署(仅[5.3 节](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-"
"cache-pool)) | — | — | — | — | — | `8000`(指标) |"

msgid ""
"Use the same checkpoint revision, tokenizer, and quantization metadata on every\n"
"node. Two addresses matter on each node: `LOCAL_IP` is the service IP that\n"
"`--host` binds and that clients and the Proxy use, and `HCCL_IF_IP` is the\n"
"communication IP owned by `NIC_NAME`. Keep them separate when the cluster has a\n"
"service network and a compute network. Make sure every node can reach the\n"
"Prefill, Decode, and Proxy service IPs."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上使用相同的 checkpoint 版本、tokenizer 和量化元数据。\n"
"每个节点上有两个地址很重要:`LOCAL_IP` 是 `--host` 绑定、\n"
"客户端和 Proxy 所使用的服务 IP,`HCCL_IF_IP` 则是由 `NIC_NAME` 持有的\n"
"通信 IP。当集群同时存在业务网络和计算网络时,请将二者区分开。\n"
"确保每个节点都能访问 Prefill、Decode 和 Proxy 的服务 IP。"

msgid "| Port or address | Purpose |"
msgstr "| 端口或地址 | 用途 |"

msgid "| `<P0_IP>`, `<P1_IP>` | Prefill node service IPs |"
msgstr "| `<P0_IP>`, `<P1_IP>` | Prefill 节点服务 IP |"

msgid "| `<D0_IP>`–`<D3_IP>` | Decode node service IPs |"
msgstr "| `<D0_IP>`–`<D3_IP>` | Decode 节点服务 IP |"

msgid "| `<PROXY_IP>` | Proxy node IP |"
msgstr "| `<PROXY_IP>` | Proxy 节点 IP |"

msgid ""
"| `7778` | Prefill and Decode HTTP API port; only P0 and D0 expose it |"
msgstr "| `7778` | Prefill 和 Decode 的 HTTP API 端口;仅 P0 和 D0 暴露该端口 |"

msgid "| `7060` | Prefill pipeline master port |"
msgstr "| `7060` | Prefill 流水线主端口 |"

msgid "| `13389` | Decode DP RPC port |"
msgstr "| `13389` | Decode DP RPC 端口 |"

msgid "| `48100` | Prefill KV transfer base port (`kv_producer`) |"
msgstr "| `48100` | Prefill KV 传输基础端口(`kv_producer`) |"

msgid "| `48200` | Decode KV transfer base port (`kv_consumer`) |"
msgstr "| `48200` | Decode KV 传输基础端口(`kv_consumer`) |"

msgid "| `<PROXY_PORT>` | Proxy HTTP API port, chosen by the operator |"
msgstr "| `<PROXY_PORT>` | Proxy HTTP API 端口,由运维人员选择 |"

msgid ""
"#### 5.2.1 Create the Engine Templates {: #521-create-the-engine-templates }"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 创建引擎模板 {: #521-create-the-engine-templates }"

msgid ""
"Save `run_p.sh` on both Prefill nodes and `run_d.sh` on all four Decode nodes.\n"
"Select the tab for the role:"
msgstr ""
"在两个 Prefill 节点上保存 `run_p.sh`,在全部四个 Decode 节点上保存 `run_d.sh`。\n"
"请按角色选择对应的标签页:"

msgid "=== \"Prefill\""
msgstr "=== \"Prefill\""

msgid ""
"Prefill is one DP1/TP4/PP4 engine spanning P0–P1 and the KV producer. P0 is the\n"
"    pipeline master and exposes the HTTP API; P1 joins as a headless worker.\n"
"    `kv_port` is a base address: each engine rank listens on `kv_port + rank`, so\n"
"    the 16 Prefill ranks need 16 consecutive ports and the 32 Decode ranks need\n"
"    32. Keep both base ports outside the Mooncake-reserved `20000–27999` range;\n"
"    the examples use `48100` and `48200`, which keeps the two ranges disjoint."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 是一个跨越 P0–P1 的 DP1/TP4/PP4 引擎,同时充当 KV producer。P0 是\n"
"    流水线主节点并对外暴露 HTTP API;P1 作为无头 worker 加入。\n"
"    `kv_port` 是基础地址:每个引擎 rank 监听 `kv_port + rank`,因此\n"
"    16 个 Prefill rank 需要 16 个连续端口,32 个 Decode rank 需要\n"
"    32 个。请将两个基础端口都保持在 Mooncake 保留的 `20000–27999` 范围之外;\n"
"    示例使用 `48100` 和 `48200`,从而使两个端口范围互不重叠。"

msgid ""
"On P1, set `LOCAL_IP`, `HCCL_IF_IP`, and `NIC_NAME` to that node, change\n"
"    `--node-rank` to `1`, and add `--headless`. Keep `MASTER_ADDR` pointing at\n"
"    P0. Every other value, including `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION`, must stay\n"
"    identical."
msgstr ""
"在 P1 上,将 `LOCAL_IP`、`HCCL_IF_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为该节点的值,把\n"
"    `--node-rank` 改为 `1`,并添加 `--headless`。保持 `MASTER_ADDR` 指向\n"
"    P0。其他所有取值(包括 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION`)都必须保持\n"
"    一致。"

msgid "=== \"Decode\""
msgstr "=== \"Decode\""

msgid ""
"Decode is one DP8/TP4 group across D0–D3, with two local DP ranks per node and\n"
"    the KV consumer. D0 is the DP coordinator and exposes the HTTP API; D1–D3 join\n"
"    as headless workers."
msgstr ""
"Decode 是一个跨越 D0–D3 的 DP8/TP4 组,每节点两个本地 DP rank,并充当\n"
"    KV consumer。D0 是 DP 协调者并对外暴露 HTTP API;D1–D3 作为\n"
"    无头 worker 加入。"

msgid ""
"On D1–D3, set `LOCAL_IP`, `HCCL_IF_IP`, and `NIC_NAME` to that node, add\n"
"    `--data-parallel-start-rank` `2`, `4`, or `6`, and add `--headless`. Keep\n"
"    `DP_ADDRESS`, the DP RPC port, and `kv_port` identical on every Decode node."
msgstr ""
"在 D1–D3 上,将 `LOCAL_IP`、`HCCL_IF_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为该节点的值,\n"
"    添加 `--data-parallel-start-rank` `2`、`4` 或 `6`,并添加 `--headless`。保持\n"
"    `DP_ADDRESS`、DP RPC 端口和 `kv_port` 在每个 Decode 节点上完全一致。"

msgid "#### 5.2.2 Start the Engines {: #522-start-the-engines }"
msgstr "#### 5.2.2 启动引擎 {: #522-start-the-engines }"

msgid ""
"Start P0, then P1, then D0–D3, and finally the Proxy in\n"
"[Section 5.2.3](#523-proxy). Start each coordinator first and bring up the\n"
"remaining nodes immediately afterward, otherwise a worker can hit the\n"
"engine-ready timeout."
msgstr ""
"依次启动 P0、P1、D0–D3,最后启动\n"
"[5.2.3 节](#523-proxy)中的 Proxy。请先启动每个协调者,并在其后立即拉起\n"
"其余节点,否则某个 worker 可能触发\n"
"引擎就绪超时。"

msgid ""
"Wait for `Application startup complete` in the P0 and D0 logs, then check both\n"
"APIs before starting the Proxy:"
msgstr ""
"等待 P0 和 D0 的日志中出现 `Application startup complete`,然后在启动 Proxy 之前\n"
"检查这两个 API:"

msgid ""
"Expected result: `200` from both. The Proxy has no `/health` route, so verify the\n"
"full chain with a request through it as described in\n"
"[Section 6.1](#61-text-requests); the KV path is working when Prefill logs the\n"
"block save for that request and Decode logs the matching load. If either check\n"
"fails, read the P0 and D0 logs and follow [Section 10](#10-faq)."
msgstr ""
"预期结果:两者都返回 `200`。Proxy 没有 `/health` 路由,因此请按照\n"
"[6.1 节](#61-text-requests)所述,通过它发送一个请求来验证\n"
"整条链路;当 Prefill 记录该请求的 block 保存、Decode 记录对应的加载时,\n"
"就说明 KV 通路工作正常。如果任一检查\n"
"失败,请查看 P0 和 D0 的日志,并参阅 [10 节](#10-faq)。"

msgid "#### 5.2.3 Proxy {: #523-proxy }"
msgstr "#### 5.2.3 Proxy {: #523-proxy }"

msgid ""
"Start the Proxy after P0 and the Decode API endpoints are ready. The general"
" multi-node PD workflow, including the Mooncake prerequisites and endpoint "
"mapping, is described in [PD Disaggregation with "
"Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#start-the-"
"service)."
msgstr ""
"在 P0 和 Decode API 端点就绪之后再启动 Proxy。通用的多节点 PD 工作流(包括 Mooncake 前置条件和端点映射)请参阅 "
"[基于 Mooncake 的 PD "
"分离](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#start-the-service)。"

msgid ""
"The Proxy script ships with the vLLM Ascend image; no separate download or "
"checkout is needed. Run it by absolute path from any working directory. If "
"you installed from source ([Section 4.2](#42-source-code-installation)), use"
" the same relative path under your checkout."
msgstr ""
"Proxy 脚本随 vLLM Ascend 镜像一起提供,无需单独下载或检出代码。可在任意工作目录下通过绝对路径运行它。如果你是从源码安装([4.2 "
"节](#42-source-code-installation)),请使用你检出的代码目录下的相同相对路径。"

msgid ""
"Register only P0 as the Prefill backend and only D0 as the Decode backend; "
"P1 and D1–D3 are headless and expose no HTTP API. Send client requests to "
"the Proxy; it forwards Prefill work to P0 and generation work to the Decode "
"group. The Proxy must forward `kv_transfer_params` unchanged, because the "
"Decode role validates the KV lease duration from that field."
msgstr ""
"仅将 P0 注册为 Prefill 后端,仅将 D0 注册为 Decode 后端;P1 和 D1–D3 是无头节点,不暴露任何 HTTP "
"API。请将客户端请求发送到 Proxy;它会将 Prefill 工作转发给 P0,将生成工作转发给 Decode 组。Proxy 必须原样转发 "
"`kv_transfer_params`,因为 Decode 角色会根据该字段校验 KV 租约时长。"

msgid "#### 5.2.4 Key PD Settings {: #524-key-pd-settings }"
msgstr "#### 5.2.4 关键 PD 设置 {: #524-key-pd-settings }"

msgid "| Setting | Prefill | Decode |"
msgstr "| 配置项 | Prefill | Decode |"

msgid "| EP | Enabled (EP16) | Enabled (EP32) |"
msgstr "| EP | 启用（EP16） | 启用（EP32） |"

msgid "| Graph mode | Disabled (`--enforce-eager`) | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` |"
msgstr "| 图模式 | 禁用（`--enforce-eager`） | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` |"

msgid "| MTP | 3 speculative tokens | 3 speculative tokens |"
msgstr "| MTP | 3 个推测 token | 3 个推测 token |"

msgid "| `--kv-cache-dtype` | Default (not set) | Default (not set) |"
msgstr "| `--kv-cache-dtype` | 默认（未设置） | 默认（未设置） |"

msgid "| `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` | `24,25,25,18` | Omitted |"
msgstr "| `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` | `24,25,25,18` | 省略 |"

msgid "| `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS` | `1` | `1` |"
msgstr "| `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS` | `1` | `1` |"

msgid "| `enable_flashcomm1` | `true` | `true` |"
msgstr "| `enable_flashcomm1` | `true` | `true` |"

msgid "| `enable_shared_expert_dp` | `true` | `true` |"
msgstr "| `enable_shared_expert_dp` | `true` | `true` |"

msgid "| `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` | `true` | `true` |"
msgstr "| `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` | `true` | `true` |"

msgid "| `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` | `1024` | `1024` |"
msgstr "| `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` | `1024` | `1024` |"

msgid "| `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` | `CCU_MS` | `CCU_MS` |"
msgstr "| `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` | `CCU_MS` | `CCU_MS` |"

msgid ""
"| KV connector | `MooncakeConnectorV2` (`kv_producer`) | "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2` (`kv_consumer`) |"
msgstr ""
"| KV 连接器 | `MooncakeConnectorV2`（`kv_producer`） | "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2`（`kv_consumer`） |"

msgid "| KV transfer port | `48100` | `48200` |"
msgstr "| KV 传输端口 | `48100` | `48200` |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_connector_extra_config` | `prefill`: DP1/TP4/PP4 with the layer "
"partition, `decode`: DP8/TP4 | Same block as Prefill |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_connector_extra_config` | `prefill`：DP1/TP4/PP4 及层划分，`decode`：DP8/TP4 "
"| 与 Prefill 相同的配置块 |"

msgid ""
"Both roles declare `kv_connector_extra_config` with the **global** Prefill "
"and Decode topology, not the local node: Prefill is one DP1/TP4/PP4 engine "
"and Decode is one DP8/TP4 group. The `prefill.pp_layer_partition` must match"
" `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION`, because the consumer uses it to map each layer "
"to the Prefill pipeline stage that holds it. Keep the same block on every "
"node of a group."
msgstr ""
"两个角色在声明 `kv_connector_extra_config` 时都要使用**全局**的 Prefill 和 Decode "
"拓扑，而不是本地节点的拓扑：Prefill 是一个 DP1/TP4/PP4 引擎，Decode 是一个 DP8/TP4 "
"组。`prefill.pp_layer_partition` 必须与 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` "
"保持一致，因为消费者（Decode）用它把每一层映射到持有该层的 Prefill 流水线阶段。请在同一组的每个节点上保持相同的配置块。"

msgid ""
"Prefill prioritizes TTFT, so it uses a larger batch-token budget and no "
"graph capture; Decode prioritizes TPOT, so it captures the decode graph and "
"uses a smaller batch-token budget. Keep `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` and "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` identical on every node of the group; a different "
"expansion mode changes the communication path and fails the process group "
"setup."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 优先考虑 TTFT，因此使用更大的 batch-token 预算且不做图捕获；Decode 优先考虑 TPOT，因此会捕获 decode"
" 图并使用较小的 batch-token 预算。请确保组内每个节点上的 `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` 和 "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` 完全一致；不同的 expansion mode 会改变通信路径，从而导致进程组建立失败。"

msgid ""
"`VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1` switches the tokenizer to the `fastokens` Rust "
"backend. It requires `pip install fastokens` (version 0.2.0 or later) in the"
" Python environment of every node where it is exported, and `python -c "
"\"import fastokens\"` must succeed in that environment; when the variable is"
" set without the package, the engine stops at startup. The setting is "
"process-scoped: it applies to the process that builds the tokenizer, which "
"is the API server on P0 and D0, and it has no effect on the headless nodes. "
"Decode also tokenizes the prompt — the Proxy forwards the original chat "
"request, and the KV transfer carries block ids only, not token ids — so keep"
" the setting identical on both roles."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1` 会将 tokenizer 切换到 `fastokens` Rust 后端。它要求在导出该变量的每个节点的 "
"Python 环境中安装 `pip install fastokens`（0.2.0 或更高版本），并且在该环境中 `python -c "
"\"import fastokens\"` 必须能够成功执行；如果设置了该变量却未安装相应的包，引擎会在启动时停止。该设置的作用域是进程级：它仅对构建 "
"tokenizer 的进程生效，即 P0 和 D0 上的 API server，对无头节点没有任何影响。Decode 也会对 prompt 进行 "
"tokenize —— Proxy 转发原始的 chat 请求，而 KV 传输只携带 block id，不携带 token id —— "
"因此请在全两个角色上保持该设置一致。"

msgid ""
"Tool calling and reasoning output are parsed inside the API server that "
"returns the response (D0 here; P0 for symmetry). Add `--enable-auto-tool-"
"choice --tool-call-parser step5 --reasoning-parser step5` to those two "
"commands as in [Section 5.1](#51-multi-node-co-located-deployment) when "
"clients send `tools` or expect a separate `reasoning_content`."
msgstr ""
"工具调用和推理输出在返回响应的那个 API server 内部进行解析（此处为 D0；为保持对称，P0 也同样如此）。当客户端发送 `tools` "
"或期望返回单独的 `reasoning_content` 时，请参照[第 5.1 节](#51-multi-node-co-located-"
"deployment)，在这两条命令中添加 `--enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser step5 "
"--reasoning-parser step5`。"

msgid ""
"### 5.3 PD Separation with KV Cache Pool {: #53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-"
"pool }"
msgstr ""
"### 5.3 基于 KV Cache 池的 PD 分离 {: #53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-pool }"

msgid ""
"This section adds a KV cache pool to the 2P4D deployment in [Section "
"5.2](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment-2p4d). MemCache backs "
"`AscendStoreConnector`, and `MultiConnector` runs two connectors in every "
"engine: `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache directly from Prefill to "
"Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` reads and writes cached prefixes in the"
" pool, so a repeated prefix is computed only once by Prefill."
msgstr ""
"本节在[第 5.2 节](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment-2p4d)的 2P4D 部署基础上增加一个 "
"KV cache 池。MemCache 为 `AscendStoreConnector` 提供后端支持，`MultiConnector` "
"在每个引擎中运行两个连接器：`MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV cache 从 Prefill 直接传输到 Decode，而 "
"`AscendStoreConnector` 则在池中读取和写入缓存的 prefix，因此重复的 prefix 只需由 Prefill 计算一次。"

msgid ""
"Every pool-connected engine rank registers its own DRAM slice with the pool,"
" so both roles contribute capacity: with `dram.size = 64GB` on all six "
"nodes, the pool has 48 ranks × 64GB = 3TiB. The data flow is one-directional"
" — Prefill writes new prefixes, Decode reads them — and the pool itself "
"holds DRAM only: each engine keeps its local HBM prefix cache as the first "
"tier and queries the pool only for the blocks that miss locally. For backend"
" installation, sizing, and eviction options, refer to the [KV Cache Pool "
"Deployment "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
msgstr ""
"每个连接到池的引擎 rank 都会向池注册自己的 DRAM 分片，因此两个角色都会贡献容量：当全部六个节点上都设置 `dram.size = 64GB`"
" 时，池共有 48 个 rank × 64GB = 3TiB。数据流是单向的 —— Prefill 写入新的 prefix，Decode 读取它们 ——"
" 并且池本身只包含 DRAM：每个引擎都以本地 HBM prefix cache 作为第一层，仅对本地未命中的 block "
"查询池。有关后端的安装、容量规划以及淘汰选项，请参阅 [KV Cache "
"池部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。"

msgid ""
"- Start MetaService first, on the Prefill master node (P0 in the reference deployment). Every pool-connected engine needs it reachable.\n"
"- Give Prefill `\"lookup_rpc_port\": \"0\"` and Decode `\"1\"`, and point every node at its own `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`.\n"
"- Keep both roles on the parallelism and scheduler limits from [Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment-2p4d); the pool adds the DRAM tier and changes the KV configuration, not the engine shape."
msgstr ""
"- 首先在 Prefill 主节点（参考部署中的 P0）上启动 MetaService。每个连接到池的引擎都需要能够访问它。\n"
"- 为 Prefill 设置 `\"lookup_rpc_port\": \"0\"`，为 Decode 设置 `\"1\"`，并让每个节点指向各自的 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`。\n"
"- 两个角色都沿用[第 5.2 节](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-deployment-2p4d)中的并行度和调度器限制；池只是增加了 DRAM 层并改变了 KV 配置，并不改变引擎的形态。"

msgid "| Element | Configuration in this deployment |"
msgstr "| 要素 | 本部署中的配置 |"

msgid "| Pool backend | MemCache (`\"backend\": \"memcache\"`) |"
msgstr "| 池后端 | MemCache（`\"backend\": \"memcache\"`） |"

msgid "| Pool transport | `device_urma` |"
msgstr "| 池传输 | `device_urma` |"

msgid ""
"| MetaService ports | `5000` (metadata), `6000` (config store), `8000` "
"(metrics) |"
msgstr "| MetaService 端口 | `5000`（元数据）、`6000`（配置存储）、`8000`（监控指标） |"

msgid "| Mooncake transfer port | `48100` (Prefill), `48200` (Decode) |"
msgstr "| Mooncake 传输端口 | `48100`（Prefill）、`48200`（Decode） |"

msgid "| AscendStore lookup port | `\"0\"` (Prefill), `\"1\"` (Decode) |"
msgstr "| AscendStore 查询端口 | `\"0\"`（Prefill）、`\"1\"`（Decode） |"

msgid ""
"| AscendStore layerwise mode | Prefill only: `\"use_layerwise\": true` on "
"Prefill and `false` on Decode.|"
msgstr ""
"| AscendStore 逐层模式 | 仅 Prefill：Prefill 上为 `\"use_layerwise\": true`，Decode "
"上为 `false`。|"

msgid ""
"| DRAM contributed per rank | `64GB`, on every rank of both roles (48 ranks "
"→ `3TiB` total) |"
msgstr ""
"| 每个 rank 贡献的 DRAM | `64GB`，两个角色的每个 rank 均是如此（48 个 rank → 总计 `3TiB`） |"

msgid ""
"The pool commands in [Section 5.3.4](#534-extend-the-engine-commands) keep "
"`--enable-prefix-caching` on both roles: each engine serves prefix hits from"
" its local HBM cache first and only queries the pool for the blocks that "
"miss in HBM, so HBM and the DRAM pool form a two-tier cache instead of the "
"pool replacing HBM."
msgstr ""
"[第 5.3.4 节](#534-extend-the-engine-commands)中的池相关命令在两个角色上都保留了 `--enable-"
"prefix-caching`：每个引擎优先从本地 HBM cache 提供 prefix 命中，仅对 HBM 中未命中的 block 查询池，因此 "
"HBM 和 DRAM 池构成了两级缓存，而不是用池替代 HBM。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.1 Prepare the Pool Components {: #531-prepare-the-pool-components }"
msgstr "#### 5.3.1 准备池组件 {: #531-prepare-the-pool-components }"

msgid ""
"The pool packages ship with the image. On every node that runs MetaService "
"or a pool-connected engine, confirm that the packages import, then add the "
"bundled native libraries to the loader path:"
msgstr ""
"池化组件随镜像一同提供。在每台运行 MetaService 或已连接池化的引擎的节点上，先确认这些包可以正常导入，然后将随附的原生库添加到加载器路径中："

msgid "Expected result: the import command exits with status `0`."
msgstr "预期结果：导入命令以状态码 `0` 退出。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.2 Configure the Metadata Service {: #532-configure-the-metadata-"
"service }"
msgstr "#### 5.3.2 配置元数据服务 {: #532-configure-the-metadata-service }"

msgid ""
"The pool uses two kinds of configuration files, read by different processes:"
msgstr "池化使用两类配置文件，分别由不同的进程读取："

msgid "| File | Read by | Copies | Content |"
msgstr "| 文件 | 读取方 | 副本数 | 内容 |"

msgid ""
"| `mmc-meta.conf` | the MetaService process (`MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH`) | one "
"per deployment | where the metadata, config-store, and metrics endpoints are"
" |"
msgstr ""
"| `mmc-meta.conf` | MetaService 进程（`MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH`） | 每个部署一份 | "
"元数据、config-store 和 metrics 端点所在位置 |"

msgid ""
"| `mmc-local-<node>.conf` | each engine (`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`) | one per "
"engine node: P0, P1, D0–D3 | the same endpoints plus the client-side pool "
"parameters (`world_size`, `protocol`, `dram.size`, `hcom_url`) |"
msgstr ""
"| `mmc-local-<node>.conf` | 每个引擎（`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`） | "
"每个引擎节点一份：P0、P1、D0–D3 | "
"与上面相同的端点，外加客户端侧的池化参数（`world_size`、`protocol`、`dram.size`、`hcom_url`） |"

msgid ""
"The standalone-provider topology described in the [KV Cache Pool Deployment "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) adds a "
"third file, `mmc-local-standalone.conf`, for the separate MemCache "
"processes. This deployment starts the pool client inside each engine, so it "
"needs only the two files above."
msgstr ""
"[KV Cache "
"池化部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)中描述的独立提供方（standalone-"
"provider）拓扑还会增加第三个文件 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`，供独立的 MemCache "
"进程使用。本部署在每个引擎内部启动池化客户端，因此只需要上述两个文件。"

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-meta.conf` on the node that runs MetaService — the Prefill "
"master P0 in the reference deployment — pointing `<POOL_META_HOST>` at an "
"address that every engine can reach over TCP (in the reference deployment, "
"the node's communication IP). Put it in a directory that every engine "
"container can read, that is, the host directory exported as "
"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` and mounted in [Section 4.1](#41-docker-image-"
"installation); [Section 5.3.5](#535-start-order-and-verification) points "
"`MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH` at this file."
msgstr ""
"在运行 MetaService 的节点上创建 `mmc-meta.conf` —— 参考部署中即 Prefill 主节点 P0 —— 将 "
"`<POOL_META_HOST>` 指向每个引擎都能通过 TCP 访问的地址（在参考部署中为该节点的通信 "
"IP）。将其放在每个引擎容器都能读取的目录中，即导出为 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 并在[第 4.1 节](#41-docker-"
"image-installation)中挂载的宿主机目录；[第 5.3.5 节](#535-start-order-and-"
"verification)会将 `MMC_META_CONFIG_PATH` 指向该文件。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.3 Configure the Pool Client on Every Engine Host {: #533-configure-"
"the-pool-client-on-every-engine-host }"
msgstr ""
"#### 5.3.3 在每个引擎主机上配置池化客户端 {: #533-configure-the-pool-client-on-every-"
"engine-host }"

msgid ""
"Create one `mmc-local-<node>.conf` per engine node — six files for this "
"topology: `mmc-local-p0.conf`, `mmc-local-p1.conf`, `mmc-local-d0.conf`, "
"`mmc-local-d1.conf`, `mmc-local-d2.conf`, `mmc-local-d3.conf`. Keep them "
"next to `mmc-meta.conf` in the same `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` directory. The "
"meta-service and config-store endpoints are the same as in `mmc-meta.conf` "
"(the client does not set `metrics_url`), and the extra lines make the node a"
" pool client; only `<HCCL_IF_IP>` differs between nodes:"
msgstr ""
"为每个引擎节点创建一个 `mmc-local-<node>.conf` —— 本拓扑共需六个文件：`mmc-local-p0.conf`、`mmc-"
"local-p1.conf`、`mmc-local-d0.conf`、`mmc-local-d1.conf`、`mmc-"
"local-d2.conf`、`mmc-local-d3.conf`。将它们与 `mmc-meta.conf` 放在同一个 "
"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 目录下。meta-service 和 config-store 端点与 `mmc-meta.conf` "
"中相同（客户端不设置 `metrics_url`），额外的行使该节点成为池化客户端；各节点之间只有 `<HCCL_IF_IP>` 不同："

msgid ""
"`hcom_url` must use the real IP of the node. The default "
"`tcp://127.0.0.1:7000` makes cross-host ranks unreachable and fails with "
"`hybm_transport_connect failed: -6`. The port base plus the local rank "
"selects the port, so eight ranks on one host use `27000–27007`. A single "
"generic file without `hcom_url`, or with one shared `127.0.0.1`, only works "
"for a one-node pool — do not reuse it for a multi-node deployment."
msgstr ""
"`hcom_url` 必须使用该节点的真实 IP。默认的 `tcp://127.0.0.1:7000` 会导致跨主机的 rank 无法互通，并报错 "
"`hybm_transport_connect failed: -6`。端口由端口基址加上本地 rank 选定，因此同一主机上的八个 rank 使用 "
"`27000–27007`。一个不含 `hcom_url` 的通用文件，或共用同一个 `127.0.0.1` 的文件，只适用于单节点池化 —— "
"请勿将其复用于多节点部署。"

msgid ""
"Both roles start the pool client inside the engine through "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`; no separate pool worker process is started."
msgstr "两种角色都通过 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 在引擎内部启动池化客户端；不会启动独立的池化 worker 进程。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.4 Extend the Engine Commands {: #534-extend-the-engine-commands }"
msgstr "#### 5.3.4 扩展引擎命令 {: #534-extend-the-engine-commands }"

msgid ""
"Starting from the engine templates in [Section 5.2.1](#521-create-the-"
"engine-templates), the pool makes four changes:"
msgstr "以[第 5.2.1 节](#521-create-the-engine-templates)中的引擎模板为基础，池化带来四处改动："

msgid ""
"- `--kv-transfer-config` becomes a `MultiConnector` with two children: `MooncakeConnectorV2` for direct Prefill-to-Decode transfer and `AscendStoreConnector` for the pool.\n"
"- `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` points at that node's pool-client file from [Section 5.3.3](#533-configure-the-pool-client-on-every-engine-host).\n"
"- `--enable-prefix-caching` stays on in both roles: each engine serves prefix hits from its local HBM cache first and only queries the pool for the blocks that miss in HBM, so HBM and the DRAM pool form a two-tier cache. `enable_lookup: true` on both `AscendStoreConnector` children turns that pool fallback on.\n"
"- The `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` from [Section 5.3.1](#531-prepare-the-pool-components) must be exported in the same shell that starts the engine, otherwise `AscendStoreConnector` cannot load the bundled MemCache libraries and pool initialization fails."
msgstr ""
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 变为包含两个子连接器的 `MultiConnector`：`MooncakeConnectorV2` 用于 Prefill 到 Decode 的直接传输，`AscendStoreConnector` 用于池化。\n"
"- `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 指向[第 5.3.3 节](#533-configure-the-pool-client-on-every-engine-host)中该节点的池化客户端文件。\n"
"- 两种角色都保持开启 `--enable-prefix-caching`：每个引擎优先从其本地 HBM 缓存返回前缀命中，仅对在 HBM 中未命中的块查询池化，因此 HBM 与 DRAM 池共同构成两级缓存。在两个 `AscendStoreConnector` 子连接器上都设置 `enable_lookup: true` 即可启用该池化回退。\n"
"- 必须在启动引擎的同一个 shell 中导出[第 5.3.1 节](#531-prepare-the-pool-components)中的 `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`，否则 `AscendStoreConnector` 无法加载随附的 MemCache 库，池化初始化将失败。"

msgid ""
"The `MooncakeConnectorV2` child keeps the `prefill`/`decode` topology block "
"from [Section 5.2.4](#524-key-pd-settings), because it is a separate "
"connector with its own extra configuration. The commands below are complete;"
" copy one per node and change only the per-node values called out after each"
" tab."
msgstr ""
"`MooncakeConnectorV2` 子连接器保留[第 5.2.4 节](#524-key-pd-settings)中的 "
"`prefill`/`decode` "
"拓扑块，因为它是独立的连接器，拥有自己的额外配置。下面的命令是完整的；每个节点复制一份，只修改各标签页之后列出的逐节点取值。"

msgid ""
"On P1, set `LOCAL_IP`, `HCCL_IF_IP`, and `NIC_NAME` to that node, point\n"
"    `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` at `${MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR}/mmc-local-p1.conf`,\n"
"    change `--node-rank` to `1`, and add `--headless`. Keep `MASTER_ADDR`\n"
"    pointing at P0. Every other value, including `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION`, must\n"
"    stay identical."
msgstr ""
"在 P1 上，将 `LOCAL_IP`、`HCCL_IF_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为该节点的值，将\n"
"    `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 指向 `${MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR}/mmc-local-p1.conf`，\n"
"    将 `--node-rank` 改为 `1`，并添加 `--headless`。保持 `MASTER_ADDR`\n"
"    指向 P0。其余所有取值（包括 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION`）必须\n"
"    保持完全一致。"

msgid ""
"On D1–D3, set `LOCAL_IP`, `HCCL_IF_IP`, and `NIC_NAME` to that node, point\n"
"    `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` at the matching\n"
"    `${MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR}/mmc-local-d1.conf`…`mmc-local-d3.conf`,\n"
"    add `--data-parallel-start-rank` `2`, `4`, or `6`, and add `--headless`. Keep\n"
"    `DP_ADDRESS`, the DP RPC port, `kv_port`, and `lookup_rpc_port` identical on\n"
"    every Decode node. If a Decode node reports\n"
"    `No available memory for the cache blocks` with `--data-parallel-size-local 2`,\n"
"    keep the four-node DP8 × TP4 group and lower `--max-model-len` first, then\n"
"    `--max-num-batched-tokens`, until the KV cache allocation succeeds."
msgstr ""
"在 D1–D3 上，将 `LOCAL_IP`、`HCCL_IF_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为该节点的值，将\n"
"    `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 指向对应的\n"
"    `${MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR}/mmc-local-d1.conf`…`mmc-local-d3.conf`，\n"
"    添加 `--data-parallel-start-rank` `2`、`4` 或 `6`，并添加 `--headless`。保持\n"
"    `DP_ADDRESS`、DP RPC 端口、`kv_port` 和 `lookup_rpc_port` 在每个 Decode 节点上\n"
"    完全一致。如果某个 Decode 节点在使用 `--data-parallel-size-local 2` 时报告\n"
"    `No available memory for the cache blocks`，请保留四节点的 DP8 × TP4 分组，先调低\n"
"    `--max-model-len`，再调低\n"
"    `--max-num-batched-tokens`，直到 KV 缓存分配成功。"

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.5 Start Order and Verification {: #535-start-order-and-verification"
" }"
msgstr "#### 5.3.5 启动顺序与验证 {: #535-start-order-and-verification }"

msgid ""
"Start MetaService on the node that hosts it — P0 in the reference "
"deployment. It has no supervisor, so keep it in the foreground or under your"
" own process manager:"
msgstr ""
"在承载 MetaService 的节点上启动它 —— 参考部署中为 P0。它没有守护进程管理，因此请让其在前台运行，或置于你自己的进程管理器之下："

msgid "The metrics endpoint returns `200` once the metadata service is ready:"
msgstr "元数据服务就绪后，metrics 端点会返回 `200`："

msgid ""
"Start the engines and the Proxy in the order given in [Section "
"5.2.2](#522-start-the-engines)."
msgstr "按照[第 5.2.2 节](#522-start-the-engines)给出的顺序启动各引擎和 Proxy。"

msgid ""
"Once the engines are ready, verify that the pool registered its capacity. "
"The metrics endpoint reports one `memcache_segment_capacity_bytes` line per "
"registered rank (48 in this topology, since both roles register) and a total"
" of 48 × 64GB = 3TiB:"
msgstr ""
"引擎就绪后，验证缓存池已注册其容量。指标端点会为每个已注册的 rank 输出一行 "
"`memcache_segment_capacity_bytes`（在此拓扑中为 48，因为两种角色都会注册），总量为 48 × 64GB = "
"3TiB："

msgid ""
"Next, send a workload whose requests share a prefix (for example, a "
"benchmark dataset with a 90% prefix repeat rate), and read the per-request "
"hit count from the Prefill log rather than from a cumulative counter:"
msgstr ""
"接下来，发送一个请求共享同一前缀的负载（例如前缀重复率为 90% 的基准数据集），并从 Prefill "
"日志中读取每个请求的命中次数，而不是从累计计数器中读取："

msgid ""
"Expected: lines of the form below, where the hit count is close to the total"
" for repeated prefixes:"
msgstr "预期结果：出现如下格式的日志行，其中对于重复前缀，命中次数接近总量："

msgid ""
"The ratio of the two numbers is the pool hit rate for that request (`117888 "
"/ 131087` ≈ 90% here). A hit rate of `0.00%` means the requests never reach "
"the pool: check the `lookup_rpc_port` values (`\"0\"` on Prefill, `\"1\"` on"
" Decode), the shared MetaService address, and each node's "
"`MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`."
msgstr ""
"这两个数值的比值即为该请求的缓存池命中率（此处 `117888 / 131087` ≈ 90%）。命中率为 `0.00%` "
"说明请求从未到达缓存池：请检查 `lookup_rpc_port` 的取值（Prefill 上为 `\"0\"`，Decode 上为 "
"`\"1\"`）、共享的 MetaService 地址，以及每个节点的 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH`。"

msgid ""
"A faster second run is not proof of a pool hit — the engine-local prefix "
"cache produces the same effect. `need to load: 0` in the same log line means"
" the local HBM already held the block. To attribute a hit to the pool, look "
"for the Prefill block-save event and the matching Decode load event, and "
"restart the engines between two identical measurements."
msgstr ""
"第二次运行更快并不能证明命中了缓存池——引擎本地的前缀缓存也会产生同样的效果。同一日志行中的 `need to load: 0` 表示本地 HBM "
"中已持有该数据块。若要将命中归因于缓存池，请查找 Prefill 的块保存事件以及与之对应的 Decode "
"加载事件，并在两次完全相同的测量之间重启引擎。"

msgid "**Common Parameter Descriptions**"
msgstr "**常用参数说明**"

msgid ""
"The deployment commands above use the parameters below. Use the values of the\n"
"selected role script; hardware-specific and role-specific values are not\n"
"interchangeable between Prefill and Decode."
msgstr ""
"上述部署命令使用了下列参数。请使用所选角色脚本中的取值；与硬件相关以及与角色相关的取值\n"
"在 Prefill 与 Decode 之间不可互换。"

msgid "| Parameter | Meaning and constraints |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 含义与约束 |"

msgid ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size`, `--pipeline-parallel-size` | TP partitions each "
"model engine across devices; PP splits it into pipeline stages. Prefill uses"
" TP4 × PP4, and Decode uses TP4 with PP1. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size`、`--pipeline-parallel-size` | TP "
"将每个模型引擎切分到多个设备上；PP 将其拆分为流水线阶段。Prefill 使用 TP4 × PP4，Decode 使用 TP4 与 PP1。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-size`, `--data-parallel-size-local` | Number of DP ranks "
"in the group and the number of ranks started on the current node. The multi-"
"node co-located deployment uses DP4 with two local ranks per node; the 2P4D "
"Decode role uses DP8 with two local ranks per node. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-size`、`--data-parallel-size-local` | 组内 DP rank "
"的数量，以及当前节点上启动的 rank 数量。多节点混部部署使用 DP4，每个节点上启动两个本地 rank；2P4D 的 Decode 角色使用 "
"DP8，每个节点上启动两个本地 rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-address`, `--data-parallel-rpc-port`, `--data-parallel-"
"start-rank` | DP coordinator address, RPC port, and the first rank of the "
"current node. Every node in a group uses the same address and port; only "
"headless nodes set the start rank. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-address`、`--data-parallel-rpc-port`、`--data-parallel-"
"start-rank` | DP 协调器地址、RPC 端口，以及当前节点的首个 rank。组内每个节点都使用相同的地址和端口；仅 headless "
"节点设置起始 rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` | Shards MoE experts across devices. Combined "
"with DP and TP, EP covers the full group: EP16 for the two-node multi-node "
"co-located deployment and EP32 for the four Decode nodes. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` | 将 MoE 专家切分到多个设备上。结合 DP 与 TP，EP "
"可覆盖整个组：两节点多节点混部部署为 EP16，四个 Decode 节点为 EP32。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-model-len` | Maximum total sequence length in tokens, including "
"input and generated output. Requests must fit this limit and the available "
"KV cache capacity. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-model-len` | 以 token 计的最大总序列长度，包括输入和生成的输出。请求必须满足该上限以及可用的 KV cache "
"容量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs`, `--max-num-batched-tokens` | Per-engine scheduler limits"
" for concurrent sequences and for tokens processed in one iteration. Prefill"
" uses a larger token budget to reduce time to first token; Decode uses a "
"smaller one to bound per-step latency. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens` | "
"每个引擎调度器的限制，分别用于限制并发序列数和单次迭代处理的 token 数。Prefill 使用更大的 token 预算以缩短首 token "
"时延；Decode 使用较小的预算以约束单步时延。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | Fraction of device memory budgeted to the "
"model executor. Despite the flag name, it also applies to the NPU backend. "
"Leave room for communication buffers; the examples use `0.9`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | 分配给模型执行器的设备内存比例。尽管该标志名为 gpu，它同样适用于 NPU "
"后端。请为通信缓冲区预留空间；示例中使用 `0.9`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--speculative-config` | Native MTP decoding. All examples use three "
"speculative tokens with `\"method\": \"mtp\"`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--speculative-config` | 原生 MTP 解码。所有示例均使用三个投机 token，并设置 `\"method\": "
"\"mtp\"`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--compilation-config` | Decode graph capture. The examples use "
"`{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}` on Decode and eager execution "
"on Prefill. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--compilation-config` | Decode 图捕获。示例在 Decode 上使用 `{\"cudagraph_mode\": "
"\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}`，在 Prefill 上使用即时执行（eager）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--additional-config` | Enables FlashComm1, shared-expert data "
"parallelism, and shared-expert overlap: `{\"enable_flashcomm1\": true, "
"\"enable_shared_expert_dp\": true, \"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": "
"true}`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--additional-config` | 启用 "
"FlashComm1、共享专家数据并行以及共享专家重叠：`{\"enable_flashcomm1\": true, "
"\"enable_shared_expert_dp\": true, \"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": "
"true}`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--kv-transfer-config` | PD KV transfer. [Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-pd-"
"separation-deployment-2p4d) uses `MooncakeConnectorV2`; [Section "
"5.3](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-cache-pool) wraps it with "
"`AscendStoreConnector` in `MultiConnector`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--kv-transfer-config` | PD KV 传输。[5.2 节](#52-multi-node-pd-separation-"
"deployment-2p4d) 使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2`；[5.3 节](#53-pd-separation-with-kv-"
"cache-pool) 在 `MultiConnector` 中用 `AscendStoreConnector` 对其进行封装。 |"

msgid ""
"| `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` | Number of model layers per pipeline stage on "
"Prefill (`24,25,25,18`). Set it on every Prefill node and leave it unset on "
"Decode. |"
msgstr ""
"| `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION` | Prefill 上每个流水线阶段的模型层数（`24,25,25,18`）。请在每个 "
"Prefill 节点上设置，而在 Decode 上不设置。 |"

msgid ""
"| `HCCL_BUFFSIZE`, `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` | CANN/HCCL communication buffer"
" size in MB and the collective expansion mode. Both change the communication"
" path and device-memory footprint; keep the same values on every node of a "
"group. |"
msgstr ""
"| `HCCL_BUFFSIZE`、`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` | CANN/HCCL 通信缓冲区大小（单位 "
"MB）以及集合通信展开模式。两者都会改变通信路径和设备内存占用；请在同一组的每个节点上保持相同的取值。 |"

msgid ""
"| `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS` | `1` selects the "
"[fastokens](https://github.com/crusoecloud/fastokens) Rust backend for "
"Hugging Face fast tokenizers, which is substantially faster on long prompts."
" Requires `pip install fastokens` (version 0.2.0 or later) in the same "
"Python environment as vLLM; with the variable set and the package missing, "
"the engine stops at startup. Only the process that builds a tokenizer is "
"affected — the API server on P0 and D0, not the headless workers. Decode "
"tokenizes the prompt as well, because the Proxy forwards the raw chat "
"request and the KV transfer carries block ids only. |"
msgstr ""
"| `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS` | `1` 表示为 Hugging Face 快速分词器选用 "
"[fastokens](https://github.com/crusoecloud/fastokens) Rust 后端，在处理长 prompt "
"时可显著提速。需要在与 vLLM 相同的 Python 环境中执行 `pip install fastokens`（版本 0.2.0 "
"或更高）；若设置了该变量但缺少该包，引擎会在启动时停止。只有构建分词器的进程会受影响——即 P0 和 D0 上的 API server，而非 "
"headless worker。Decode 也会对 prompt 进行分词，因为 Proxy 转发的是原始 chat 请求，而 KV 传输只携带 "
"block id。 |"

